cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "resistentia: response termination for autonomous systems"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Wyciślak
    given-names: Sławomir
    affiliation: Jagiellonian University, Kraków
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reference implementation of response termination for autonomous and
  semi-autonomous systems. Supplies an activation stock with a lagged suppressor
  stock, danger-theory signal fusion in which a threat signature without a
  distress context produces tolerance rather than a response, negative-selection
  detectors, and a diagnostic that reads response pathologies from an existing
  alerting log. Derived from the resistance concept set out in the author's 2003
  doctoral dissertation.
references:
  - type: thesis
    title: "Koncepcja rezystencji polskich przedsiębiorstw w warunkach działania na rynku międzynarodowym"
